OL,3,GNEWSATeacher unions to start action
OL,4,Ashort of strike over workload pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeachers in Northern Ireland will take
OL,7,Findustrial action short of a strike as
OL,8,Fpart of a dispute over what they
OL,9,Fdescribe as "unsuitable workloads".
OL,11,FThe NI Teachers Council, which
OL,12,Frepresent the five teaching unions in
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland, said the action will
OL,14,Fbe begin next Monday, 28 September.
OL,16,FIt added it was not able to secure a
OL,17,Fresolution to reduce workload for
OL,18,Fteachers and school leaders.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
